---
title: Celery Seed Dressing
author: Lois Austin
category: Sauces & Dressings
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@confectioner's sugar{1/2%c}
@apple cider vinegar{1/4%}
@paprika{1%tsp}
@salad oil{1%c}
@mustard{2%tsp}
@salt{1%tsp}
@celery seed{1%tsp}

Combine everything except oil. Slowly add oil, heating constantly until thickened. Cover and chill.
